  "notes": "### Changed\n- The morning summary is now a Good morning window inside Pyxida instead of a notification. It opens once a day, the first time you use Pyxida after your morning time, with the weather, your day as a timeline of meetings, timed tasks and free time, tasks stuck for a week with one-click moves to tomorrow, next week or no day, and the first tasks of each area, which you can tick off right there. Settings > Reminders has Show now to open it any time.\n\n### Fixed\n- The morning summary used to appear only when a task had a deadline, so many people never saw it.",
